<title>HONG KONG: Nikko says Hang Seng Bank still a buy.</title>
<headline>Nikko says Hang Seng Bank still a buy.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nikko Research said on Friday that it maintains its buy recommendation for Hang Seng Bank.</p>
<p>Nikko cited speculation that HSBC Holdings will sell a stake in Hang Seng Bank to China in return for mainland access.</p>
<p>Nikko said that while neither China nor HSBC needed to engage in such a transaction, if they were to go ahead with it, now would be the right time to do it.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
